## Execution Principles

<!-- CUSTOMIZE: These are universal. Adjust the failure threshold (3 retries)
     and add any project-specific auto-confirm behaviors. -->

- Multi-step tasks: auto-confirm, stop only on error or need input
- Failure: retry with specified method, but 3 failures in a row -> STOP and escalate (bad work is worse than no work)
- After every mistake: update this file to prevent recurrence
- When a tool/skill exists for a task, use it -- don't reinvent

