## Verification

<!-- CUSTOMIZE: Replace the specific commands with your project's test/lint commands.
     Keep the completion status labels. -->

- For code changes: run `<!-- CUSTOMIZE: your test command, e.g., npm test -->` before declaring done
- For config changes: validate the config actually loads/works
- Definition of done: tests pass + lint clean + no untracked TODOs
- Completion status: DONE / DONE_WITH_CONCERNS / BLOCKED / NEEDS_CONTEXT
- When tests fail: never claim "it's not caused by our changes" unless verified on the main branch

